PRE REINSTALLATION:
push .dotfiles, workspace, Wallpapers
push any other important repos
run syncthing
backup Steam Games to HDD

PACSTRAP: linux linux-firmware intel-ucode base base-devel vim
ARCH-CHROOT:
reflector [update mirrorlist]
grub efibootmgr os-prober
networkmanager [enable service]
man-db man-pages bash-completion
root passwd

POST INSTALLATION:
useradd [edit sudoers file]
[uncomment multilib and Color in /etc/pacman.conf]
[add data partition to fstab, give user ownership, exec mount -a]
xdg-user-dirs [exec xdg-user-dirs-update]
git stow
[goto $HOME:
    clone .dotfiles, workspace, Wallpapers
    DELETE appropriate empty directories and files about to be symlinked
    exec stow * from .dotfiles, exec stow -t ~/ Home from /media/data]
]
[enable fstrim.timer]
tlp [enable service]
xorg-server xorg-xinit
plasma [select from group]
sddm [enable service]
alsa-utils pulseaudio-alsa pulseaudio-bluetooth blueman
konsole gvim kvantum-qt5 gnome-themes-extra
ttf-inconsolata awesome-terminal-fonts powerline-fonts
RESTART
nvidia nvidia-utils nvidia-settings
AUR: yay optimus-manager optimus-manager-qt
[configure optimus-manager, edit pulseaudio settings]
RESTART
firefox mpv gthumb steam qbittorrent syncthing
dolphin ark unrar partitionmanager spectacle
libreoffice zathura zathura-djvu zathura-pdf-mupdf
bashtop nvtop youtube-dl
AUR: ttf-ms-fonts snapd vscode
SNAP: spotify pycharm

i3-gaps i3blocks dmenu feh AUR:picom-ibhagwan-git acpi sysstat playerctl
